  {
   "id": "soundfall-106821@major-2022-03-19",
   "gameId": "soundfall-106821",
   "displayName": "Soundfall Development Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-03-19T15:36:21.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's been a minute. Things have been really busy with the team over the past year to say the least. But we are tuning up our gear and getting ready for some big and exciting news in the coming weeks.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Firstly we are happy to say that Soundfall is in the home stretch. It has been a long road with a lot of bug fixing, game play balance and that final tiny bit of development that always seems to take the longest to get done. We also want to take a second to thank everyone in the closed beta for your help. The game wouldn't be what it is today without you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "On the fun side our marketing push leading up to release will be kicking off soon. This includes all new assets and more importantly, a brand new trailer! I've watched it a million times and it still gets me hyped.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you want to stay tuned to all things Soundfall give the team a follow over on socials @soundfallgame or stay locked in here as we will be pushing regular updates now for foreseeable future. In the meantime, enjoy this first look at the new banner art for the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
